    "canonical_ref": "PL13.CO.s2",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "in quarum priore contineri partem cognovi sermonis de symbolo adversus paganos et Arianos, quem inter spu- rios Augustinianos collocant Maurini editores, in tomi VIII appendice, p. 11, sqq.",
