    "work_id": "oglt-pl/anonymus/pl13_21_co",
    "canonical_ref": "PL13.CO.s10",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Inter multa quae Ariani adversus catho- licam fidem solent disputare, hoc sibi maxime callidissimum machinamentum proponere videntur cum dicunt, etc.",
    "chunk_index": 9,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 405,
    "date_range": [
      360,
      450
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/anonymus/pl13_21_co#PL13.CO.s11",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/anonymus/pl13_21_co",
    "canonical_ref": "PL13.CO.s11",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "In membranas calce scribitur nota quaternionis septimi; unde cognoscimus reliquum esse fragmentum ex aliquo majore codice. .... non edocti humanae sapientiae verbis, sed docti spiritu.",
    "chunk_index": 10,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 405,
    "date_range": [
      360,
      450
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/anonymus/pl13_21_co#PL13.CO.s12",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/anonymus/pl13_21_co",
    "canonical_ref": "PL13.CO.s12",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Redde ergo, haeretice, quod docuit spiritus; redde ut fides non sit in sapientia homi- num, et haeresis non erit.",
    "chunk_index": 11,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 405,
    "date_range": [
      360,
      450
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
    "out_of_period": false,
    "translation_group_id": null
  },
  {
    "chunk_id": "oglt-pl/anonymus/pl13_21_co#PL13.CO.s13",
    "work_id": "oglt-pl/anonymus/pl13_21_co",
    "canonical_ref": "PL13.CO.s13",
    "language": "lat",
    "text": "Et ne diutius immoremur, veniamus ad ea, quae nobis tamquam murum fer- reum opponere consuerunt dicentes : ingenitus et genitus idem est, necne?",
    "chunk_index": 12,
    "context_before": null,
    "context_after": null,
    "date_composed": 405,
    "date_range": [
      360,
      450
    ],
    "date_confidence": "approximate",
